		{
			"id": "spec",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 698,
			"color": "6",
			"text": "## Spec · Loops\n*Edit this card to change what the canvas shows. Agents re-render everything else from it via [[Render Canvas v1.0.0]].*\n\n**Purpose.** A working map of the team's open loops: the current Team Weekly, and every Loop run in progress.\n\n**Top:** the open `Team Weekly v1.0.0` run as a hub: centre the live loop-card; top a Reading card (phase against evidence, Reservoir state as in [[Loop v2.0.0]], what changed, what needs a person); left its active Decisions; right the issues the team means to close this week; bottom the Calls of the week.\n\n**Below, one hub per other open loop run**, sub-loops in the row below their parent: centre loop-card; left active Decisions originating in it; right its open issues; bottom its unresolved Letters summarised.\n\n**Always:** a live `open-loops` table and a live `closed-loops` card for the last 90 days.\n\n**Live vs agent:** lists are live views from dashboards/views/; agent cards carry judgement. Each list sits in a labelled group.\n\n**Edges:** none.\n\n**Triggers:** when a loop opens, closes or changes phase; at each Team Weekly's Laydown and Observe; on request.\n\nKinds: Loop v2.0.0, Team Weekly v1.0.0, Letter v1.0.0, Call v1.0.0\n"
		}
